      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_d91d199f4c2685d672fc239a089d409f23a65c1e4f75e079fc6d5da570142544"
      ],
      "text": "Tool-output compression applies per-tool line caps (bash 80, read 300, grep 120), strips ANSI, collapses blank lines, and does semantic JSON/XML extraction, with claimed cuts of 67–94%."
    },
