      ],
      "text": "An autonomous 'Ralph-style' goal loop is triggered by 'caveman goal start', with rolling state, per-iteration cost/token ledger, shadow-git checkpoints, and ranked termination conditions (sentinel, iteration cap, dollar cap, no-progress, SIGINT)."
    },
