      "text": "Persistent memory is delegated to cavemem (hybrid BM25 + local vectors on SQLite/FTS5); the agent exposes memory_search and memory_save tools, auto-injects relevant recall each turn capped at 2k tokens by default, and can fall back to plain markdown files via memory.provider: files."
    },
